    C --> DB[(MySQL 8\nBANK 1─* ACCOUNT 1─* TRANSACTION)]
    DB --> V[Decimal computation\nvalidation · source hash]
    V --> P[Privacy sanitizer\nmask account/UTR\nredact narration]
    P --> AR[Immutable AnswerReceipt]
    AR --> API
    API --> FE

    API <--> S[(Redis\nQueryState · receipts · idempotency)]
    API --> W[Celery worker]
    W --> DB
    W --> X[(Sanitized export)]

    G[(Evaluation gold\noffline only)] --> E[Evaluation runner]
    E --> I
    E --> R

